# This file's mere existence is load-bearing: vsce falls back to .gitignore when
# there is no .vscodeignore, and .gitignore excludes the generated media/
# subdirectories. Because this file exists, .gitignore is not consulted and the
# mirrored assets are packaged as they must be. Do not delete it.
